{"id":"ef101d71722ee067","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-cantor-space.md","title":"Cantor 空间的基本开柱","display":"df-cantor-space — Cantor 空间的基本开柱","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-cantor-space","aliases":["20-df-cantor-space"],"display":"df-cantor-space — Cantor 空间的基本开柱","chapter":"8","section":"8.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definitions 8.1.1–8.1.2","source_pdf_pages":[198,199],"source_printed_pages":[165,166],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-cantor-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-cantor-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cantor-space — Cantor 空间的基本开柱"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 8.1.1–8.1.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>198</span><span>199</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>165</span><span>166</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(U\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n[\\sigma]:=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\sigma\\preceq X\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Open}(U)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[U=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]],\\\\\nd(X,Y):=\\begin{cases}0&amp;X=Y,\\\\2^{-\\mu n[X(n)\\ne Y(n)]}&amp;X\\ne Y.\\end{cases}\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n[\\sigma]:=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\sigma\\preceq X\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Open}(U)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[U=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]],\\\\\nd(X,Y):=\\begin{cases}0&amp;X=Y,\\\\2^{-\\mu n[X(n)\\ne Y(n)]}&amp;X\\ne Y.\\end{cases}\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>基本开柱也是闭集，其直径至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span>。此 ultrametric 与基本开柱产生同一个拓扑。方括号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]\">\\([\\sigma]\\)</span> 与树路径集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\">\\([T]\\)</span> 通过参数类型区分。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 8.1.1–8.1.2；印刷页 165, 166；PDF 第 198, 199 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n[\\sigma]:=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\sigma\\preceq X\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Open}(U)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists S\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\\n[U=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]],\\\\\nd(X,Y):=\\begin{cases}0&X=Y,\\\\2^{-\\mu n[X(n)\\ne Y(n)]}&X\\ne Y.\\end{cases}\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"2^{-|\\sigma|}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"[T]","display":false}],"bytes":1263,"backlinks":[{"id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]。"},{"id":"978bb51599bc5702","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]。"},{"id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]。"},{"id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"683b778af72202b5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-tree]]。"},{"id":"84785d7ea3ad1a08","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]。"},{"id":"ac9dde66604507b2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-cantor-space]]。"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435"]}